{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415033","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415033","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041503301:0":{"text":"세시아 님...\n꼬, 꽃이 필요하신가요?","source_cn":"瑟西娅女士……\\n您，想要一些花吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1734D6E388BE0F91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503302:0":{"text":"내게 주는 건가? 좋아, 미스터 칼라일에게 꽂아주도록 하지.","source_cn":"送给我？可以，我会插在卡莱尔先生身上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6C879B246C947D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503303:0":{"text":"...전 이 꽃들이 좋아요.","source_cn":"……我喜欢这些花。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860DFD8D66534843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503304:0":{"text":"꽃들은 아름답고 조용하거든요.","source_cn":"它们总是很美丽，而且安静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38435E3E8C4FABE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503305:0":{"text":"우리처럼 말이에요...","source_cn":"就像是我们一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0490C2162317331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503306:0":{"text":"네 취향의 일부는 나도 동의해.","source_cn":"我部分赞同你的品味。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA64219B8676ECA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503307:0":{"text":"이 꽃들은 아름다운 모습을 하고 있지만, 너무 조용해.","source_cn":"这些花朵的确有着迷人的姿态，但，太过安静了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x268BAA7E952476E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503308:0":{"text":"상상해 봐. 만약 묘지에 활짝 핀 곳이 날카로운 비명을 지르고 있다면, 얼마나 아름다울지 말이야.","source_cn":"试想下，如果墓园里盛开着花朵，并伴有悦耳的惨叫，那该多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD42A0501EA82E92F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503309:0":{"text":"우리의 삶은 너무나도 고요해서 약간의 소란도 필요한 법이라고.","source_cn":"我们的生涯已经太过宁静，正需要些许吵闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECC9F969BE109B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"루보미르","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟西娅":{"text":"세시아","source":"瑟西娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}